  "body": "As the [feature is currently spec'ed](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/web-messaging.html#broadcasting-to-other-browsing-contexts), [BroadcastChannel](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/web-messaging.html#broadcastchannel) allows same origin contents with different top-level domains to communicate with one another. This allows scripts in those same origin contents to track users across different top-level domains.\r\n\r\nWe need to partition BroadcastChannel based on top-level domain like other storage APIs.",
